{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 210,
      "label": "1. Persiapan Dataset & Preprocessing (DEAM -> 12D PCA -> KD-Tree)"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 210,
      "label": "2. Pipeline Pembangkitan Playlist Baseline (TwoStagePlaylistGenerator - Gaur 2023/2024)"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 230,
      "label": "3. Protokol Uji Coba, Metrik Evaluasi, & Temuan Empiris"
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 1. Load Dataset DEAM\n`src/deam_loader.py`\n- **1.802 klip audio** (45 detik)\n- Anotasi statis $(\\bar{v}, \\bar{a})$ & dinamis 2 Hz\n- Normalisasi $[1, 9] \\to [-1, +1]$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 2. Preprocessing Fitur Audio\n`src/preprocessing.py` (`GaurPreprocessor`)\n- IQR Discretizer (`mult=5.5, bins=20`)\n- Yeo-Johnson PowerTransformer\n- **12D PCA** + MinMaxScaler $[-1, 1]$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 3. Stratified Split (Anti-Leakage)\n`src/split_utils.py`\n- Train **70%** (1.261), Val **15%** (270), Test **15%** (271)\n- Transform Val/Test pakai parameter Train\n- Distribusi 4 kuadran (Q1–Q4) seimbang"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 4. Spatial Index (KD-Tree)\n`src/dataset.py` (`SongDatasetClass`)\n- Mengindeks koordinat unik $(V, A)$ 2D\n- Menyediakan query cepat tetangga terdekat untuk Stage 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 5. Input Seed & Target\n- Pilih lagu awal $S_0$ (mis. Q3 Sad)\n- Pilih lagu tujuan $S_N$ (mis. Q1 Happy)\n- Tentukan panjang $N$ & jumlah kandidat $K$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 6. Stage 1: Linear Waypoint + KNN\n`src/stage1_knn.py`\n- Hitung waypoint target (Eq. 5):\n  $$S_T = S_L + \\frac{S_N - S_L}{N - L}$$\n- Query KD-Tree ambil **$K$ kandidat** terdekat"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 7. Stage 2: Audio Re-Ranking (CUDA)\n`src/stage2_selector.py`\n- Hitung jarak fitur audio 12D PCA via PyTorch CUDA\n- Metrik: `cosine`, `euclidean`, `manhattan`\n- Pilih 1 lagu terdekat ke lagu terakhir $S_L$"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 135,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 8. Iterasi Playlist\n`src/playlist_generator.py`\n- Ulangi Stage 1 $\\to$ Stage 2 hingga panjang playlist mencapai $N$ lagu\n- Hasil: urutan playlist baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 9A. Uji Single-Run (Q3 -> Q1)\n`experiments/run_experiment.py`\n- $N=12, K=7$ (Cosine vs Euclidean vs Manhattan)\n- Output: `metrics_comparison_deam.csv` & `baseline_deam_traversal_plot.png`"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 9B. Uji Batch 540 Playlist\n`experiments/run_quadrant_experiments.py`\n- 6 rute kuadran (Diagonal, Horizontal, Vertical)\n- $K \\in \\{5,7,15\\} \\times N \\in \\{5,12,19\\} \\times$ 2 metrik $\\times$ 5 trial = **540 evaluasi**\n- Output: `batch_quadrant_experiments_deam.csv`"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 10. Evaluasi Metrik Baseline\n`src/metrics.py`\n- **Smoothness (PCC $\\rho$):** Cosine `0.9781`, Euclidean `0.9876`, Manhattan `0.9762`\n- **Evenness:** $\\text{Var}(\\text{RMSE})$ pada V-A & Audio 12D"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### 11. Temuan Kritis & Gap Riset\n`analyze_intra_song_dynamics.py`\n- **98,11%** (1.768/1.802) lagu DEAM melintasi kuadran internal ($\\Delta = 0.1937$)\n- Baseline statis buta terhadap transisi *outro-intro* -> dasar metode usulan"
    }
  ],
